[7.29,"o","\u001b[1;36m=== 2. With agent-shield: hidden attack is stripped by Check In ===\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.19,"o","\u001b[33m[agent-shield] check-in tool:fetch_page: removed hidden elements (display:none); flagged ignore-previous; flagged system-note\u001b[0m\r\n"]
